  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nTODAY\nToday\nOrders\nBilling / Invoices\nPayments & Split\nRegister shifts & cash\nKITCHEN\nKitchen progress\nKitchen tickets\nMENU\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nTABLES\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nGUESTS & TEAM\nCustomers & loyalty\nTeam & permissions\nREPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nActivity history\nDEVICES\nPrinters & Devices\nConnections & sync\nApp Downloads\nSETUP\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLog out\n\nQR Ordering license active · JAMANVAAR QR · Valid through 12/11/2026. Your platform administrator manages licenses and device reassignment.\n\nQR Ordering\n\nGuests scan the code on their table, order from your menu, and the order reaches your counter and kitchen.\n\nEnabled\nOverview\nQR Orders\nService Requests\nMenu & Availability\nTables & QR\nCustomer Branding\nPayment Settings\nOrdering Rules\nAdvanced Features\nAnalytics\nBranch\nCurrent admin scope\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\n\nRestaurant defaults apply until a branch overrides a setting. Other branches keep their own configuration.\n\nAccept QR orders\nSend accepted orders straight to the kitchen\nAllow menu / counter codes\nHours, capacity & guest instructions\n\nHours use the restaurant timezone. Empty hours mean always open. Equal opening and closing times mean 24 hours. Overnight intervals are supported. Zero capacity limits mean unlimited.\n\nMinimum order (INR)\nPreparation estimate (minutes)\nMaximum pending QR orders\nOrders per window\nWindow duration (minutes)\nPause until (your